Defensive Architecture & Safety Invariants
The implementing agent must enforce all established project rules:

Defensive Admin Protection:
Never allow an admin to demote themselves.
Never allow reducing total active admins to zero.
Safety Snapshots:
Always trigger createSeasonSafetySnapshot before season activation, result publication corrections, or Hall of Fame finalization.
Driver Reference Integrity:
Never allow deleting drivers referenced in historical picks or results (drivers.is_active = false must be used instead).
Audit Logging:
Every mutation (role change, invite code update, rules doc update, historical HoF import, storage cleanup, error resolve) must record an entry via recordAdminAudit.
Scoring Cache Invalidation:
Any change affecting scoring, drivers, races, or participants must call invalidateScoringCache().
Schema Contract:
Do not alter EXPECTED_SCHEMA_VERSION unless a database migration is specifically applied and verified. All new features here leverage existing tables, RPCs, and storage APIs without requiring schema version changes.
